<li><a href="/topic/ai-hacking-tool-warning" lang="en">Security agency warns about an open-source AI hacking tool</a> <data value="151">151</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/frontier-model-backlash" lang="en">New frontier model keeps drawing benchmarks and backlash</a> <data value="144">144</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/decoy-discounts" lang="en">Black Friday decoy discounts: 29% of 351 deals saved nothing</a> <data value="131">131</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/open-weights-quarter-price" lang="en">Open-weights model released with pricing at 25% of flagship</a> <data value="126">126</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/assistant-wallet" lang="en">Chat assistant gets a wallet and starts paying for you</a> <data value="124">124</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/airline-bans-booking-agents" lang="en">Airline bans AI agents from booking flights</a> <data value="99">99</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/super-agent-flash-model" lang="en">Lab releases a super-agent and a faster flash model</a> <data value="80">80</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/browser-agent-permissions" lang="en">Browser vendor adds a permissions prompt for agents</a> <data value="74">74</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/cloud-outage-postmortem" lang="en">Postmortem of last week&#39;s inference outage</a> <data value="68">68</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/robotaxi-permit-expands" lang="en">Robotaxi permit expands to two more cities</a> <data value="63">63</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/retailer-extension-recall" lang="en">Retailer recalls a browser extension after a data leak</a> <data value="57">57</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/context-registry-opens" lang="en">A public registry for agent tool servers opens</a> <data value="49">49</data></li>
<li><a href="/topic/quantum-error-rate-claim" lang="en">Quantum startup claims a record low error rate</a> <data value="44">44</data></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section class="band" aria-labelledby="band-classifieds">
