<li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41005" lang="en">The quiet return of RSS, by the numbers</a></li>
<li>Bluesky key accounts: <a href="https://bluesky.example/item/41006" lang="en">A browser vendor hints at built-in agent permissions</a></li>
<li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41007" lang="en">A spreadsheet engine written in 900 lines</a></li>
<li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41008" lang="en">What we learned from a year of agent evaluations</a></li>
<li>Hacker News front page and Show HN: <a href="https://hackernews.example/item/41009" lang="en">Ask HN: who still self-hosts their email?</a></li>
<li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41010" lang="en">Chip export rules, explained in five charts</a></li>
