<li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41003" lang="en">Notes on giving agents a memory that survives restarts</a></li>
<li>Lobsters hottest: <a href="https://lobsters.example/item/41004" lang="en">A 4-bit model that runs on a three-year-old phone</a></li>
<li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41005" lang="en">The quiet return of RSS, by the numbers</a></li>
<li>Bluesky key accounts: <a href="https://bluesky.example/item/41006" lang="en">A browser vendor hints at built-in agent permissions</a></li>
